  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/VeEQ2N0\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_56694573-3efa-443a-8633-442df914dc86.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"200\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/allthemods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_a3275c3a-969a-4088-a2c5-53d65a37be07.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/allthemods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_54901d94-6ad2-4408-869f-27ba9026b292.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"49\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/AllTheMods/All-the-mods-10-Sky\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_b33feea2-9c55-4bae-9b5d-fff3e2ac52db.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"49\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://github.com/AllTheMods/All-the-mods-10-Sky/raw/refs/heads/main/presskit.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_c784751f-c531-4487-994e-5049e59f02d2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"197\" height=\"49\"></a></span></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>欢迎来到&nbsp;<strong>All the Mods 10: 冲向天空</strong></span></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">ATM10 与经典空岛挑战的终极融合！从一棵树、一块方块开始，在虚空中开拓天地，海量模组任你探索。</span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>性能提示：</strong>建议分配至少 <strong>6–8 GB 内存</strong> 以获得最佳体验。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>多人游戏支持：</strong>完全兼容服务器和局域网联机。</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>任务可选：</strong>可按指引完成，亦可自主开辟道路。<br><br><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe style=\"width:360px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/LCvCpUhfL2A?si=3FpBxJL1qXK9pgST\" width=\"360\" height=\"216\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:360px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Hh7aLmgwyMc?wmode=transparent\" width=\"360\" height=\"217\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/TzgaPq6XY6k\" width=\"360\" height=\"202\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YvkYIdQNoJU\" width=\"360\" height=\"202\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>All the Mods 10</strong> 以其庞大且精心整合的顶级模组库而闻名，如今它以空岛形式重获新生！从零开始，利用现代自动化、魔法、科技与探索，在虚空中建立你的空中帝国。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1298402/description_f0f52e24-87e6-4993-bd25-9abce9997875.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"731\" height=\"175\"></p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>特别感谢 Howester84 对本整合包两大热门岛屿的贡献！他还有更多精彩设计及内容，欢迎在他的 Discord 社区支持他：<a href=\"https://discord.gg/r6V28h8grJ\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击这里</a></strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>该版本将 ATM10 的强力模组世界转变为基于进度的空岛挑战，要求玩家创造性地思考并高效自动化，方能触及终局内容。<br><br>本次最大的变化是：我们已迁移至 <strong>NeoForge</strong>，并采用 <strong>1.21</strong> 版本。随着模组持续更新，敬请期待更多内容！</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">在 <strong>All the Mods 10: 冲向天空</strong> 中，我们将延续传统，在追求更高稳定性的同时加入众多新模组。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>“All the Mods” 真的包含所有模组吗？不，当然不是。</strong></span></p>",
